OL,3,A'I performed on stage to get my first
OL,4,Ajob' - the firms turning recruitment
OL,5,Ainto competitions
OL,6,
OL,7,FYumi Liberman was up on stage in front
OL,8,Fof a panel of judges and an audience of
OL,9,F300 people, and she had to perform.
OL,11,FBut rather than singing, dancing or
OL,12,Fplaying a musical instrument, she and
OL,13,Ftwo friends were in an auditorium in
OL,14,FLondon in 2024 to pitch their business
OL,15,Fidea, hoping to secure a full-time job
OL,16,Fwith cosmetics giant L'Oreal.
OL,18,F"It reminded me of when I used to do
OL,19,Fcompetitive sports growing up and the
OL,20,Fpressure would get heavy," says
OL,21,FLiberman, now 24. "But somehow you just
OL,22,Fget into flow mode."
