OL,3,A'I performed on stage to get my first
OL,4,Ajob' - the firms turning recruitment
OL,5,Ainto competitions
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe and her friends had got through to
OL,8,Fthe UK final of Brandstorm, an
OL,9,Finternational competition run by the
OL,10,FFrench company, where young adults
OL,11,Foutline their product and business
OL,12,Fideas.
